0200d279b3c8.plain:
During your Shooting phase, once a POXMONGERS DAEMON ENGINE unit of yours is picked to shoot, these apply for the rest of the phase:
- its models may shoot Blast weapons at units that are in Engagement Range of their own unit;
- whenever one of its models makes a ranged attack against an enemy unit in Engagement Range of their unit, that attack's hit roll gets 1 added.

056a538db8f8.plain:
During your Shooting phase, once a PLAGUEBURST CRAWLER model of yours is picked to shoot, these apply for the rest of the phase:
- every attack it makes with a Plagueburst mortar has Damage 3;
- after its shooting is done, pick one enemy unit that was hit this turn by at least one of its Plagueburst mortar attacks. For every other unit within 3" of that enemy unit (not counting NURGLE units), roll a D6: on a 4+, the unit rolled for takes 1 mortal wound.

a27a83d8f027.plain:
Malediction: if manifested, choose an enemy unit within 18" of this PSYKER. Until your next Psychic phase starts:
- it can't Advance;
- whenever it is picked to charge, only eligible units within 6" may be chosen as its charge targets;
- its charge rolls can't be re-rolled.

b84c407715f2.plain:
Models in this unit that shoot Rapid Fire bolt weapons ignore the usual Rapid Fire rules and instead double their number of attacks when any of these is true:
- their target is within half the weapon's range;
- the firing model is Infantry, and its unit Remained Stationary during your previous Movement phase;
- the firing model is a Terminator.
For this ability, any bolt weapon (as the rules define them) whose type is Rapid Fire counts as a Rapid Fire bolt weapon.

e0f021ff2a5b.plain:
During the Fight phase, once a POXWALKERS unit of yours is picked to fight, these apply to every attack its models make for the rest of the phase:
- on an unmodified hit roll of 6, the target also takes 1 mortal wound on top of any normal damage;
- on an unmodified hit roll of 1, that POXWALKERS unit takes 1 mortal wound once that fight is resolved.
